' S-271 / Mete K3 2026-10-28: iki USING'ten gelen ayni ad, nitelensiz cagri = altı yolda ayni DERLEME hatasi (once HIC yazilmaz).
NAMESPACE A
    FUNCTION Topla(x AS I32, y AS I32) AS I32
        RETURN x + y
    END FUNCTION
END NAMESPACE
NAMESPACE B
    FUNCTION Topla(x AS I32, y AS I32) AS I32
        RETURN x * y
    END FUNCTION
END NAMESPACE
USING A
USING B
PRINT "once"
PRINT Topla(3, 4)
